msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/hs3003.rst:34
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Een geconfigureerde :py:class:`machine.I2C`\\ -bus waaraan de sensor is "
"gekoppeld."

#: ../../library/hs3003.rst:36
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/hs3003.rst:37
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x44``, the factory address "
"used by all HS3003 parts."
msgstr ""
"7-bits I2C-adres van het apparaat. Standaard ``0x44``\\ , het fabrieksadres "
"dat door alle HS3003-onderdelen wordt gebruikt."

#: ../../library/hs3003.rst:42
msgid ""
"Trigger a measurement and return the relative humidity in percent (``%RH``),"
" computed as ``(raw & 0x3FFF) / 16383 * 100``."
msgstr ""
"Activeer een meting en geef de relatieve vochtigheid in procent (\\ "
"``%RH``\\ ) terug, berekend als ``(raw & 0x3FFF) / 16383 * 100``\\ ."

#: ../../library/hs3003.rst:47
msgid ""
"Trigger a measurement and return the temperature in degrees Celsius, "
"computed as ``(raw >> 2) / 16383 * 165 - 40``."
msgstr ""
"Activeer een meting en geef de temperatuur in graden Celsius terug, berekend"
" als ``(raw >> 2) / 16383 * 165 - 40``\\ ."
